  testimonials: [{"name": "Shri VENKATESH", "link": "/profile/lawyers/l-1784514523770", "comment": "\"I had the opportunity to work closely with the team at SKV Law Offices on the transaction concerning the partnership between Tata Power and Druk Green for the development of the 1,125 MW Dorjilung Hydropower Project in Bhutan. I found Shri, Pranav, and Ashutosh to be highly professional, responsive, and commercially astute throughout the engagement. Their advice was consistently practical, solution-oriented, and aligned with the strategic objectives of the transaction. The team demonstrated a strong grasp of complex legal and regulatory issues, managed stakeholder expectations effectively, and maintained excellent standards of diligence and execution. In particular, they were proactive in identifying and mitigating risks, provided clear and timely guidance on critical matters, and contributed significantly to the smooth progression of the transaction. Their collaborative approach and commitment to delivering results made them valuable advisors on the project. I would be pleased to recommend SKV Law Offices for complex infrastructure, energy, and cross-border transactions. Shri led the SKV team on Dorjilung from the outset, and he was the person I went to when we needed a decision rather than an analysis. The structure moved considerably between the first shareholders' discussions and signing, and through that he was consistently able to tell us which positions were genuinely worth holding and which were not. That judgement is what I value in outside counsel on a transaction of this length. He is also reachable when it matters.\"", "author": "Ajay Kapoor, Chief (Legal, Regulatory and Advocacy)", "company": "Tata Power Company Limited"}, {"name": "Pranav BHASKAR", "link": "/profile/lawyers/l-1785729609075", "comment": "\"I had the opportunity to work closely with the team at SKV Law Offices on the transaction concerning the partnership between Tata Power and Druk Green for the development of the 1,125 MW Dorjilung Hydropower Project in Bhutan. I found Shri, Pranav, and Ashutosh to be highly professional, responsive, and commercially astute throughout the engagement. Their advice was consistently practical, solution-oriented, and aligned with the strategic objectives of the transaction. The team demonstrated a strong grasp of complex legal and regulatory issues, managed stakeholder expectations effectively, and maintained excellent standards of diligence and execution. In particular, they were proactive in identifying and mitigating risks, provided clear and timely guidance on critical matters, and contributed significantly to the smooth progression of the transaction. Their collaborative approach and commitment to delivering results made them valuable advisors on the project. I would be pleased to recommend SKV Law Offices for complex infrastructure, energy, and cross-border transactions. Pranav ran the commercial documentation and was our team's principal point of contact through negotiation. He is precise on drafting without losing the commercial thread, which is a harder combination than it sounds. He also managed the cross-border elements sensibly, treating the Bhutanese counterparty's constraints as facts to be worked with rather than positions to be argued down.\"", "author": "Ajay Kapoor, Chief (Legal, Regulatory and Advocacy)", "company": "Tata Power Company Limited"}, {"name": "Ashutosh SRIVASTAVA", "link": "/profile/lawyers/l-1785729722143", "comment": "\"I had the opportunity to work closely with the team at SKV Law Offices on the transaction concerning the partnership between Tata Power and Druk Green for the development of the 1,125 MW Dorjilung Hydropower Project in Bhutan. I found Shri, Pranav, and Ashutosh to be highly professional, responsive, and commercially astute throughout the engagement. Their advice was consistently practical, solution-oriented, and aligned with the strategic objectives of the transaction. The team demonstrated a strong grasp of complex legal and regulatory issues, managed stakeholder expectations effectively, and maintained excellent standards of diligence and execution. In particular, they were proactive in identifying and mitigating risks, provided clear and timely guidance on critical matters, and contributed significantly to the smooth progression of the transaction. Their collaborative approach and commitment to delivering results made them valuable advisors on the project. I would be pleased to recommend SKV Law Offices for complex infrastructure, energy, and cross-border transactions. Ashutosh handled the execution workstream and kept a long approval sequence moving. Responsive, well organised, and he raised issues with us early rather than presenting them once they had become problems. Straightforward to work with.\"", "author": "Ajay Kapoor, Chief (Legal, Regulatory and Advocacy)", "company": "Tata Power Company Limited"}, {"name": "Muzhou LIANG", "link": "/profile/lawyers/Muzhou-LIANG-1719199780722", "comment": "\"Our company engaged lawyers LIANG Muzhou, HOU Yu, HAN Xinxin, YANG Ting, and CHEN Jianming from ETR Law Firm to provide litigation services in relation to a series of construction contract disputes arising from a new energy vehicle base project of a major real estate group. After accepting the engagement, the legal team assisted our company in systematically organizing the case facts, conducted detailed analysis of key disputed issues, including the retrial time limits and admissibility of new evidence, with reference to relevant regulations and judicial precedents, and proactively planned the approach for exercising the priority right to payment. Ultimately, the retrial court reversed the original judgments and upheld our claim for priority right to payment, laying the foundation for our company's subsequent participation in asset distribution. Throughout the entire process, the team performed professionally and pragmatically, handled complex procedural issues appropriately, prepared thoroughly for court hearings, and maintained timely and clear communication. Based on our actual experience, this team possesses the capability to handle similar complex construction disputes, and we are willing to recommend them to other entities or individuals with comparable needs. 我司曾因某大地产集团新能源汽车基地建筑工程纠纷系列案，委托广东广信君达律师事务所梁沐周、侯榆、韩欣欣、杨挺、陈鉴明律师提供诉讼服务。 该律师团队接受委托后，协助我司系统梳理案件事实，围绕再审期限、新证据认定等关键争议，结合相关法规及司法案例进行细致论证，并提前规划优先受偿权的行使路径。最终再审法院依法改判，支持了我司优先受偿权的请求，为我司后续参与财产分配奠定了基础。在整个过程中，该团队表现专业、务实，对复杂程序问题的应对较为妥善，庭审准备充分，沟通及时清晰。基于我司的实际体验，该团队具备处理同类复杂建筑工程纠纷的能力，我司愿向有类似需求的单位或个人予以推荐。\"", "author": "PANG Shuhan, Risk Control Department Manager", "company": "Zhongdi Junhao High Tech Co., Ltd"}],
